{#
  The facts of a delivery card as a table, like the details of a template: a title row over both columns, then one row per fact
  (a bold label in a 20% column, the value beside it). Shared by the cards that report what another system knows about a
  dispatch (_dispatch_mautic.html.twig, _dispatch_provider.html.twig), so they look alike. Use it instead of a bullet list.

  Variables
    - title  already translated
    - rows   list of {label, values, muted, danger}: label is already translated; values is a list, each one a text or
             {url, text} (the url in its own span, the text in brackets); muted / danger color the row (optional)
#}
<div class="panel shd-none mb-0 n8ndispatch-facts">
    <table class="table table-hover mb-0 n8ndispatch-mautic-facts">
        <thead>
            <tr><th colspan="2">{{ title }}</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for row in rows %}
            <tr{% if row.muted|default(false) %} class="text-muted"{% elseif row.danger|default(false) %} class="text-danger"{% endif %}>
                <td width="20%"><span class="fw-b textTitle">{{ row.label }}</span></td>
                <td>
                    {% for value in row.values %}
                        <div>{% if value is iterable %}<span class="n8ndispatch-mautic-url">{{ value.url }}</span> ({{ value.text }}){% else %}{{ value }}{% endif %}</div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
